@startuml
!include plantuml-theme.puml
scale max 760 width

actor Supervisor
participant "LLM Agent" as Agent
participant "SKILL.md" as Skill
participant "Python package" as Package
participant "LaTeX toolchain" as Toolchain

Supervisor -> Agent : 请求生命周期操作
Agent -> Skill : 路由请求并检查授权边界
Skill -> Package : 调用确定性命令
Package -> Toolchain : compile / diff / package
Toolchain --> Package : PDF、diff、diagnostics
Package --> Skill : 状态与正式产物
Skill --> Agent : 验证后的结果
Agent --> Supervisor : 报告结果或请求显式确认

alt 需要修改科研内容
  Supervisor -> Agent : 提供或确认精确修改
  Agent -> Package : 仅应用已确认操作
  Package --> Agent : 更新后的受控状态
end
@enduml
